<title>USA: Continental Airlines considering buyback.</title>
<headline>Continental Airlines considering buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc Chairman Gordon Bethune said Thursday that carrier was considering a plan to repurchase its shares.</p>
<p>&quot;We're in talks about a share buyback,&quot; Bethune said during a presentation with industry analysts. &quot;It's something every responsible company should consider.&quot;</p>
<p>Bethune did not specify the size or timing of a possible buyback.</p>
